SUMMARY:Parkwood Resource Fest
DESCRIPTION:Alliance Health is partnering with Parkwood Elementary School to host an End-of-Year Celebration & Community Resource Fair on May 22nd\, 3:30-5:30PM. \nThis event is all about bringing together local vendors\, organizations\, and families for a day of fun\, connection\, and meaningful resource sharing. Vendor organizations will have the opportunity to showcase what they offer\, engage with the community\, and build lasting relationships with youth and families. Attendees will enjoy games\, activities\, music\, and access to helpful community resources. \nFree to attend. Register to be a vendor.
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/parkwood-resource-fest/
LOCATION:Parkwood Elementary School\, 5207 Revere Road\, Durham\, North Carolina\, 27713
END:VEVENT
